  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Spring into savings with 10% off🏖️<br><br>Escape to this stylish boho beach home, where coastal charm meets modern comfort. Located just minutes from the beach, this 3-bedroom, 2-bath plus game room retreat is perfect for families, friends, or a romantic getaway. Unwind in your private, year-round backyard oasis featuring a covered patio, pool, and fire pit. Hop in the 6-person golf cart and you’ll be dipping your toes in the sand in no time!🌴🌊🌞!<br><br>✨ PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS ✨ <br><br>Surfing Turtle features a King-sized Master retreat that features two walk-in closets and an ensuite plus two additional guest rooms. One guest suite offers a queen-sized bed and access to the second bathroom. The bunk room features a set of queen beds that adults or kids enjoy! <br><br>The heart of the home is the large open floor plan featuring a gourmet kitchen, large island with seating, dining room, and living room where all can unwind for a movie night or gather around the island sipping your favorite drinks! The outdoor covered patio is an extension to the open floor plan. The covered patio features an outdoor dining table, outdoor kitchen, and outdoor seating whereas you can cozy up to evening fires!<br><br>Soak up the Florida sun by lounging in one of our pool loungers or cool off and take a dip in our pool. As the sun goes down, gather around our firepit to roast some marshmallows and feel the stress melting away stress, enveloped by the peaceful ambiance of this outdoor oasis.<br><br>Don’t forget to take your best shot at someone in ping pong. Our heated/cooled garage has been converted to a game room featuring a sleeper sofa sectional, television, ping pong table, Pac Man arcade, and card table!<br><br>SPECIAL NOTE: This property has a pool. Please bring appropriate life vests for guests who cannot swim. Always be vigilant with young children around the pool area and never leave guests who cannot swim unattended. Swimming is at your own risk.<br><br>*The pool has a heater. There is an additional charge of $100/day for the pool to be heated. The pool temperature will be between 78-88 degrees when heated. You must request and pay to have the pool heater turned on during your stay.*<br><br>You will receive a digital code to access the front door lock to the home a day prior to your arrival.<br><br>I plan to interact with the guests to ensure they have a five star stay!<br><br>Our home is in Inlet Beach. You are a 1–2-minute drive away from the beautiful beaches of the Emerald Coast. <br><br>Inlet Beach, a hidden gem along the Emerald Coast renowned for its pristine white sands, turquoise waters, and relaxed atmosphere. Nestled between Panama City Beach and Rosemary Beach, Inlet Beach offers a perfect blend of tranquility and convenience, making it an ideal destination for your beach getaway.<br><br>The crystal-clear waters are perfect for swimming, paddle boarding, or snorkeling, providing endless opportunities for aquatic adventures. Watch dolphins play offshore or try your hand at fishing in the surf for a taste of local coastal life.<br><br>*Parking for 4-5 vehicles depending on size*<br>*The property comes with 4 beach chairs, 1 beach wagons, and 1 umbrella for your enjoyment*<br>*The property offers beach towels for use during your stay*<br>- No smoking <br>- No events, parties or large gatherings<br>- Must be at least 25 years old to book<br>-Swim at your own risk. NO LIFE GUARD ON DUTY! NO DIVING!! Keep back privacy gate and back door secured at all times for safety.<br>-1 dog allowed with a pet fee, message host to see if additional pets allowed<br>- Clean up after your dog, no feces left in yard<br>- Animal must have all shots that are required by a veterinarian.<br>-Registered guest has full responsibility of the animal(s) during the stay.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
